cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or the Word2Vec models, please cite the paper below."
title: "PH-Senti-Toolkit"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dlsucelt/PH-Senti-Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Tokenizer and pretrained Word2Vec models from Co et al. (2025),
  "Exploring Emoji-based Synthetic Annotations for Filipino-English
  Sentiment Analysis". Released for research transparency; not
  production-ready.
keywords:
  - sentiment analysis
  - Filipino
  - Tagalog
  - code-switching
  - Twitter
  - word2vec
  - tokenizer
